  /* ---------------- NEXT BEST ACTION ----------------
     The strip is one slot showing the single most useful thing THIS visitor
     could do next. Candidates declare when they apply and how strongly;
     the highest scorer wins, and up to three rotate.

     To drive this from the real recommendation engine, set
       window.GP_NBA = [{id, text, href, cta, score, urgent}, ...]
     before this script runs, or resolve window.GP_NBA_PROMISE (a promise of
     that array). Anything returned replaces the local candidates entirely.
     The local set below is the offline fallback and must always be safe to
